THE SLAB OMITS THE STATISTICS
The prototype's band carries 2,400+ properties, 87 suburbs and 4.8/5 handover
confidence. Those figures are invented. product-guidelines.md makes trust the central
constraint and product.md makes accountants the acquisition channel, so unverifiable
social proof is a poor trade for one row of visual interest. Only the statement ships.
Absence is now asserted by a script rather than left to inspection.

DIVIDER LOGIC IN 'HOW IT WORKS'
First attempt put md:border-l on every column but removed it only from the first, which
would have drawn a stray left rule on the item starting the second row at the two-up
breakpoint. Rules now run horizontally when stacked or two-up and vertically only at
four-up. The bottom rule is kept in all cases, matching the prototype.

WHY A COPY VERIFICATION SCRIPT
Transcription is the whole risk in this phase, and eyeballing paragraphs against a spec
is exactly the check a person performs badly. scripts/verify-landing-copy.mjs asserts
every verbatim string the spec requires against the LIVE page, not the source, so entity
escaping and JSX whitespace collapsing are exercised too. It also asserts the absence of
the excluded content. Requires the dev server running; invoke with node.

